-- Playbook database-correction.water-invoice-recreation 1.0.0; shared PBR01..06/PAR01..07 apply.
-- Canonical guide: ../../invoice-receipt-correction/references/sql-contracts.md
-- Domain context: Unpaid water invoice removal & new invoice recreation.
-- Generate pure scoped SELECTs after actual utility/schema inspection; never infer payer uniqueness across municipalities.
--
-- Water invoice removal & recreation investigation checklist:
-- 1. Entity & Municipality Resolution:
--    Resolve municipality -> SID -> unique entity (water_id) using consumer number (water_no, e.g. 68002492);
--    Confirm recipient address, meter size, and demographic info in public.water_fee_detail.
-- 2. Target Invoice Eligibility Check (PBR-01, PBR-06):
--    Inspect target public.water_fee_invoice rows:
--    - Verify status is unpaid (e.g. 'invoice_status_4' or 'invoice_status_1').
--    - Verify receipt_id IS NULL and payment_date IS NULL.
--    - Verify printed_date IS NULL.
--    - Confirm no online bank payments in public.ktb_transaction_item or public.water_fee_ktb_transaction.
-- 3. Mapping & Integration Verification:
--    Inspect public.water_fee_invoice_transaction for target invoices:
--    - Identify linked water_fee_transaction rows (must already reflect corrected volumes/fees from database-correction.water-meter-reading).
--    - Identify any linked garbage transactions (garbage_transaction_id) to ensure integrated billing is preserved.
-- 4. Sequencing & Reference Structure:
--    - Check latest invoice_no sequence in public.water_fee_invoice for the target round and municipality SID.
--    - Inspect ref_1 and ref_2 structure to ensure correct derivation for the new invoices.
-- 5. Rate & PromptPay Payload Pre-calculation (PBR-05):
--    - Calculate new total amount = water_fee + integrated garbage_fee (if applicable).
--    - Derive QR text satang payload (|TaxID%0ARef1%0ARef2%0ASatang) and barcode text.
-- 6. Template & Authentic Signer Resolution (PBR-09):
--    Inspect template and signer configuration in public.water_invoice_template and public.user:
--    - Retrieve active template_id for municipality SID (WHERE sid = '<SID>' AND is_active = true) or from old target invoice.
--    - Verify template_id exists in public.water_invoice_template.
--    - Retrieve authentic municipal officer userid in public.user (e.g. U2025030014) for created_by / updated_by.
--    - Extract signer metadata: main_user_fullname, main_user_position, main_user_signature.
--    - Extract consumer demographic fields from public.demographic / public.water_fee_detail:
--      meter_zone_name, ref_keyword, legal_status, title, firstname, lastname.
--    - CRITICAL: Never use Jira card keys (e.g. 'SU-10768') in created_by; missing template_id or invalid created_by crashes NestJS getInvoiceDetail with HTTP 500 (TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined reading 'title').
SELECT 'AUTHORING_TEMPLATE_ONLY: derive complete scoped water invoice removal, mapping links, and invoice recreation SELECTs' AS template_status;
